      "writtenOn": "2018-08-02T02:14:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Apart from the somehow horrible macro ,-P, do you really need to reset all registers? It seems like the code below is setting most/all of them?",
      "revId": "bf3d7d392472c74198367681671c0330c5985697",
