      "writtenOn": "2018-08-02T22:07:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Which macros exactly?  Can you give an example using them for this?\n\nI didn\u0027t find any examples of macros being used for the \"mask\" arg to gpio_set_alternate_function().\n\nNote that GPIO_MASTER_I2C_SCL and GPIO_MASTER_I2C_SDA are 28 and 29, respectively.  They\u0027re not the bitmask values needed here.",
      "parentUuid": "bc2dce79_50415d53",
      "revId": "bf3d7d392472c74198367681671c0330c5985697",
