        "id": 1129199
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-08-03T02:25:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please do this:\n\nboard/servo_micro/gpio.inc:\nALTERNATE(PIN_MASK(B, 0x0300), 1, MODULE_SOMETHING, 0) /* XYZZ: PB08/PB09 - Description */\n\nHere:\n\ngpio_config_module(MODULE_SOMETHING, 1);\n\nThen disable when you are done:\n\ngpio_config_module(MODULE_SOMETHING, 1);",
      "parentUuid": "195c9438_00d64b50",
      "revId": "bf3d7d392472c74198367681671c0330c5985697",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
