      "message": "Take a look at patchset 12.  Is that what you have in mind?  I can\u0027t test it from home, I\u0027ll let you know if it works when I\u0027m in the office tomorrow i.e. when I have a Servo Micro available. :-)\n\nFYI if you\u0027re counting bytes, the gpio_config_module() calls use 8 more bytes than the gpio_set_alternate_function() calls (23672 bytes free now, vs 23680 bytes free previously).",
