      "writtenOn": "2018-08-06T03:57:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Re byte count, I\u0027m not saying we should throw away any good coding practice to save bytes (we\u0027d write everything in assembly if we were that concerned...). I\u0027m just saying we should not waste space with useless stuff.\n\ngpio_config_module looks good.",
