        "id": 1291807
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-08-02T22:07:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is true, but it\u0027s no more code to just call reset_tim16_tim17() since it exists anyways.  I think it\u0027s polite to reset everything, e.g. if another routine using these timers isn\u0027t as defensive.",
      "parentUuid": "a711a641_629dc8b8",
      "revId": "bf3d7d392472c74198367681671c0330c5985697",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
