      "writtenOn": "2018-08-06T03:57:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, 56 bytes seems fine, until people start becoming defensive all over the place and add kilobytes. Maybe it does not matter for servo_micro as we\u0027re unlikely to run out of space, but, again, that\u0027s not how we usually do things in the EC codebase.\n\nMy point is, we\u0027re not doing this anywhere else, don\u0027t do it in new code either.",
      "parentUuid": "c459e713_dab97093",
